{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOURNEY INTO MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art restorer Kaelin Rykhard is invited by the reclusive painter Felix Mortimer to review his famous collection. When Rykhard arrives at the mansion, Mortimer is missing, the place is damaged, and strange artworks hint at something terrifying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/543c49e15933e0e936bf6f9c452da511.poster.avif?t=1763481631\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/543c49e15933e0e936bf6f9c452da511.webm?t=1763481631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/543c49e15933e0e936bf6f9c452da511.mp4?t=1763481631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN EVER-CHANGING\u00a0NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams, ghouls, ghosts \u2014 make your way through an oscillating chateau ripe with\u00a0paranormal\u00a0phenomena never repeating and always spine-chilling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/5a725dcc4e348c7def24271e59cee7c8.poster.avif?t=1763481631\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/5a725dcc4e348c7def24271e59cee7c8.webm?t=1763481631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/5a725dcc4e348c7def24271e59cee7c8.mp4?t=1763481631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Voice the monster using your microphone;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Record a message into your microphone and listen to it on the in-game Gordon Baker Radio Show, it should be fun;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each location has unique mechanics, so you will need to find the right ways to survive;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The environment is fully interactive and has many details to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/d8b2a2f688f96a211b8de19cc86bb03f.poster.avif?t=1763481631\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/d8b2a2f688f96a211b8de19cc86bb03f.webm?t=1763481631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756580/extras/d8b2a2f688f96a211b8de19cc86bb03f.mp4?t=1763481631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Boo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2756580/03fbc58751ed815d5af5719b7cf0e1fe3730ab15.jpg"},{"name":"Wet Exit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2756580/ed78f2062d0d6daddcb2d74f2e00287ad6b8a49d.jpg"},{"name":"Walls Are Talking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2756580/309a5826313813eb05e5cea42c714258c56b66da.jpg"},{"name":"Not so deep!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2756580/fe5afc5d2edc447627163894b99773c3c35e852a.jpg"},{"name":"I Want Pizza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2756580/6b7dda0d58bf740ac25230a8ca5dd2ccf427dc64.jpg"},{"name":"C